    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a piece about the massive shift toward automation in the workforce. i've been seeing a lot of talk about how this is just \"the next stage of evolution\" and basically unavoidable. do you think the move to an automated economy is an inevitable social evolution, or is it more of a policy choice?",
